### Organism/PricingTable/PricingTable.vue

Renders a `<table>`

| Prop | Default | Type |
| --- | --- | --- |
| plans | - | `PricingTablePlan[]` |
| sections | - | `PricingTableSection[]` |

Bind to PricingTableHeader.compareDifferences. If set to true, only render rows with `hasDifference = true`.

Template of this component may look something like this

```html
<table>
  <PricingTableHeader [table header props...] />
  <tbody>
    <template v-for="section in sections">
      <PricingTableSectionHeader [section header props...] />
      <tr v-for="row in rows">
        <PricingTableRowHeader [row header props...] />
        <PricingTableRowValue [basic props...] />
        <PricingTableRowValue [premium props...] />
        <PricingTableRowValue [enterprise props...] />
      </tr>
    </template>
  </tbody>
</table>
```
